= Install Fira Code

Ligature-first coding face. Not the DevCentr terminal default.

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `fira-code`.

::: playbook [id="install-fira-code" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install Fira Code?" intent="cli.install" tool="fira-code"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="fira-code" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
